  "details": "There should be a button on the VRChat website that lets you download a world you want to visit later to your cache. Useful for those with slow connections, or the simple convenience of seeing a cool world on twitter/discord/etc. and wasting no time downloading it in game by downloading it ahead of time, while still being able to do something else in the mean time. Additionally, predownloaded worlds could be added to the Recently Visited tab, or a new tab called \"recently downloaded\" could be made as well, so they can be the first things you see when you hop in game and open the main menu.",
